      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} I figured out this only sems to happen when I am in FBT using 6 point tracking (headset, 2 controllers, 3 vive trackers).\n\nIt also looks fine in the mirror and for other people. It only gets scrambled and stuck in one position from my own POV.\n\nI made a button to turn off and on the cloth component, which helps when you have cloth stuck in something and cannot get it out etc, but it does not seem to fix this problem at all. \n\nResetting the avatar fixes the problem, unless you chang worlds and it happens again.\n\nOn desktop everything works OK.",
